# Pipeline TODO discipline

## Source of truth

Read and update [`docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md`](docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md) for Stage 0
scientific milestones. Session TodoWrite items must mirror that file when the
task is pipeline work. Numbering index:
[`docs/plans/MILESTONE_INDEX.md`](docs/plans/MILESTONE_INDEX.md).

## At session start (and before new pipeline work)

1. Open `docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md`.
2. Read the **Roadmap** (sections 1→5). Today = **section 2** (G1 gene-holdout
   smokes). Do **not** restart N-light 5×6 or Milestone 10 topology work.
3. Work that sequence; pending / deferred (sections 4–5) wait until earlier
   sections clear. Numeric milestone IDs stay; execution order is not numeric.

## When marking complete

Only set status to `done` when the milestone's **Done when** acceptance criteria
are truly met (reports, artifacts, tests, or round-trip checks exist). Scaffolding,
CLI stubs, download scripts, or model class definitions alone are not enough.

Update `docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md` in the same change set that finishes the milestone.
Keep Cursor session todos in sync (complete / cancel / start next).

## Ordering (do not reorder milestone IDs without an ADR)

```text
1. DONE       1–11 ATS, 10e, 12 N-light, G2 N-light YES
2. NEXT       G1 gene-holdout: cascade random → nested → N-light random →
              nested (cascade first; chrom optional / not queued — DeepRVAT-like)
3. AFTER G1   product defaults + seed bank + full-width + sampler
4. PENDING    cascade 5×6; G3 platform; 10d ckpt; paper checklist
5. DEFERRED   expression aux; Stage 1+; ensemble
```

Historical aliases `7G` / `7G′` / `7H` / “Milestone 7 OOF” appear in older
plans and `stage0_7g_*` artifact paths — prefer new numbers in new writing.

Ordering after Milestone 6 is locked by
[`docs/adr/0007-crossfit-prerequisites.md`](docs/adr/0007-crossfit-prerequisites.md)
and [`docs/adr/0008-score-identifiability.md`](docs/adr/0008-score-identifiability.md).
Programme brief:
[`docs/plans/post-v0-scientific-programme.md`](docs/plans/post-v0-scientific-programme.md).
Do not retrain v0.1. Do not launch cascade 5×6 before GATE G1–G3. Architecture
ranking uses methylation-input methods only (not metadata-only).

Before starting **5c**, read `docs/EWAS_METADATA.md` and
`reports/inspection/ewas_metadata_structure/summary.md`.
Before residual Milestone **10** / GPU-queue work, read the campaign log
[`docs/plans/milestone-7h-pretrained-mbs-rbs-campaign.md`](docs/plans/milestone-7h-pretrained-mbs-rbs-campaign.md)
and stub [`docs/plans/milestone-10-pretrained-mbs-rbs.md`](docs/plans/milestone-10-pretrained-mbs-rbs.md).
Before gene-holdout / 12b, read
[`docs/plans/milestone-12b-full-gene-panel.md`](docs/plans/milestone-12b-full-gene-panel.md),
[`docs/plans/milestone-12b-gene-holdout.md`](docs/plans/milestone-12b-gene-holdout.md),
and the product seed recipe
[`docs/plans/milestone-12b-deeprvat-seed-recipe.md`](docs/plans/milestone-12b-deeprvat-seed-recipe.md).
Before paper figures, read [`docs/TODO_PAPER.md`](docs/TODO_PAPER.md) (after
pipeline gates).
